WEBVTT

00:07:57.873 --> 00:08:01.212
But unfortunately, without gravity,

00:08:01.212 --> 00:08:03.142
tears don't fall.

00:08:03.142 --> 00:08:06.166
So you just get a bigger and 
bigger ball of whatever that is

00:08:06.166 --> 00:08:08.174
mixed with your tears on your eye

00:08:08.174 --> 00:08:10.652
until eventually, the ball becomes so big

00:08:10.652 --> 00:08:13.213
that the surface tension takes it 
across the bridge of your nose

00:08:13.213 --> 00:08:14.947
like a tiny little waterfall

00:08:14.947 --> 00:08:17.022
and goes "goosh" into your other eye,

00:08:17.023 --> 00:08:20.490
and now I was completely blind

00:08:20.490 --> 00:08:23.588
outside the spaceship.

00:08:23.588 --> 00:08:26.167
So what's the scariest thing you've ever done?

00:08:26.167 --> 00:08:29.869
(Laughter)

00:08:29.869 --> 00:08:31.349
Maybe it's spiders.